export const SHOWCASE_CHARS = {
 "Thessaly Brightwater": "---\ntype: character\nkind: pc\nclass: Wizard\nsubclass: Evoker\nlevel: 5\nspecies: Elf\nbackground: Sage\nalignment: Neutral Good\nconcept: A scholar who follows her missing master's trail of burnt notebooks.\nplayer: Sam\nhp: 32\nac: 11\ninit: 1\nspeed: 9 m\nperception: 11\nprof: 3\nstr: 8\ndex: 13\ncon: 15\nint: 17\nwis: 12\ncha: 10\nsource: DM Forge Character Library\nupdated: 2026-11-02\n---\n\n# Thessaly Brightwater\n\n*Level 5 Elf Wizard (Evoker) · Sage · Neutral Good*\n\n**AC** 11 (No armour) · **HP** 32 (5d6) · **Initiative** +1 · **Speed** 9 m · **Proficiency** +3\n\n| Str | Dex | Con | Int | Wis | Cha |\n|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|\n| 8 (−1) | 13 (+1) | 15 (+2) | 17 (+3) | 12 (+1) | 10 (+0) |\n\n**Saving Throws** Int +6, Wis +4  \n**Skills** Arcana +6, History +6, Insight +4, Investigation +6  \n**Passive Perception** 11\n\n## Proficiencies\n\n- **Weapons.** Simple weapons\n- **Tools.** Calligrapher's Supplies\n\n## Features\n\n- **Arcane Recovery** _(Wizard 1)_. You can regain some of your magical energy by studying your spellbook.\n- **Ritual Adept** _(Wizard 1)_. You can cast any spell as a Ritual if that spell has the Ritual tag and the spell is in your spellbook.\n- **Spellcasting** _(Wizard 1)_. As a student of arcane magic, you have learned to cast spells.\n- **Scholar** _(Wizard 2)_. While studying magic, you also specialized in another field of study.\n- **Wizard Subclass** _(Wizard 3)_. You gain a Wizard subclass of your choice.\n- **Ability Score Improvement** _(Wizard 4)_. You gain the Ability Score Improvement feat (see \"Feats\") or another feat of your choice for which you qualify.\n- **Memorize Spell** _(Wizard 5)_. Whenever you finish a Short Rest, you can study your spellbook and replace one of the level 1+ Wizard spells you have prepared for your Spellcasting feature with another level 1+ spell…\n- **Evocation Savant** _(Evoker 3)_. Choose two Wizard spells from the Evocation school, each of which must be no higher than level 2, and add them to your spellbook for free.\n- **Potent Cantrip** _(Evoker 3)_. Your damaging cantrips affect even creatures that avoid the brunt of the effect.\n- **Darkvision** _(Elf)_. You have Darkvision with a range of 60 feet.\n- **Elven Lineage** _(Elf)_. You are part of a lineage that grants you supernatural abilities.\n- **Fey Ancestry** _(Elf)_. You have Advantage on saving throws you make to avoid or end the Charmed condition.\n- **Keen Senses** _(Elf)_. You have proficiency in the Insight, Perception, or Survival skill.\n- **Trance** _(Elf)_. You don't need to sleep, and magic can't put you to sleep.\n- **Magic Initiate (Wizard)** _(Origin feat)_.\n\n## Spells\n\n**Spellcasting ability** Int · **Spell save DC** 14 · **Spell attack** +6\n\n**Slots** L1: 4 · L2: 3 · L3: 2\n\n**Cantrips** [[Fire Bolt]], [[Mage Hand]], [[Light]], [[Prestidigitation]]\n\n**Prepared** [[Shield]], [[Magic Missile]], [[Detect Magic]], [[Sleep]], [[Misty Step]], [[Hold Person]], [[Fireball]], [[Counterspell]], [[Fly]]\n\n## Equipment\n\n- 2 Daggers\n- Arcane Focus (Quarterstaff)\n- Robe\n- Spellbook\n- Scholar's Pack\n- 5 GP\n\n## Basics\n\n**Alignment:** Neutral Good\n\n**Player:** Sam\n\n**One-line concept:** A scholar who follows her missing master's trail of burnt notebooks.\n\n**Age:** 112\n\n**Pronouns:** she/her\n\n**Height (cm):** 168\n\n**Weight (kg):** 58\n\n**Eyes:** Grey\n\n**Hair:** Silver, in a long braid\n\n**Languages:** Common, Elvish, Draconic\n\n## Appearance and voice\n\n**Appearance:** Silver braid, ink-stained fingers, a scorched left sleeve she refuses to mend.\n\n**Scars, tattoos, marks:** A faint burn scar across the left palm.\n\n**Voice:** Quiet and precise, speeds up when excited.\n\n**Mannerisms and habits:** Taps two fingers on the table when impatient.\n\n## Personality\n\n**Personality trait:** Curious about everything, especially things that explode.\n\n**Ideal:** Knowledge: the world is a puzzle to be solved.\n\n**Bond:** My old master vanished and I want to know why.\n\n**Flaw:** I touch things I was told not to touch.\n\n**Fears:** Being forgotten.\n\n**What they want right now:** Find Master Orrin, alive or not.\n\n## Backstory\n\n**Where did they grow up?** Raised in the Silverwood library-town of Ael Varen.\n\n**Why did they take up this life?** Orrin took her on as an apprentice after she rewrote a spell in the margin of a textbook.\n\n**What event changed them?** The night the east wing of the library burned and Orrin was not among the survivors.\n\n**What did they leave behind?** A reading room of her own, and a cat named Footnote.\n\n## Relationships\n\n**Allies and friends:** [[Old Haldor]], who lets her read the shrine records.\n\n**Rivals and enemies:** Whoever burned the library.\n\n**Ties to the other PCs:** Trusts Kestra to get her out of trouble and Bram to patch her up afterwards.\n\n## Family tree\n\n**Parents and guardians:** Maelis Brightwater (mother, cartographer).\n\n**Siblings:** None.\n\n## Timeline\n\n**Timeline of life events:** Age 6: Found the library under the old mill\nAge 19: Apprenticed to Orrin\nAge 60: Orrin disappears\n1 year ago: Joined the party in Greenhold\n\n## Bonds with the other PCs\n\n**How we met:** Kestra picked her pocket in Greenhold and returned it, annoyed there was nothing worth taking.\n\n## Hooks for your DM\n\n**Story hooks I would love:** Orrin's notebooks. A library fire that was not an accident.\n\n**What my character would never do:** Burn a book.\n\n---\n_Built with the SRD 5.2.1 (CC-BY 4.0). Includes material from the System Reference Document 5.2.1 (“SRD 5.2.1”) by Wizards of the Coast LLC, available at https://www.dndbeyond.com/srd. The SRD 5.2.1 is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License, available at https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode._\n\n<!-- dmforge:character {\"v\":1,\"kind\":\"pc\",\"name\":\"Thessaly Brightwater\",\"level\":5,\"cls\":\"Wizard\",\"sub\":\"Evoker\",\"species\":\"Elf\",\"speciesNote\":\"High Elf\",\"bg\":\"Sage\",\"bgMode\":\"21\",\"bgA\":\"Int\",\"bgB\":\"Con\",\"method\":\"std\",\"base\":{\"Int\":15,\"Con\":14,\"Dex\":13,\"Wis\":12,\"Cha\":10,\"Str\":8},\"skills\":[\"Investigation\",\"Insight\"],\"extraSkill\":\"\",\"extraFeat\":\"\",\"cantrips\":[\"Fire Bolt\",\"Mage Hand\",\"Light\",\"Prestidigitation\"],\"prepared\":[\"Shield\",\"Magic Missile\",\"Detect Magic\",\"Sleep\",\"Misty Step\",\"Hold Person\",\"Fireball\",\"Counterspell\",\"Fly\"],\"kit\":\"A\",\"gear\":[]} -->\n",
 "Korg Ironhand": "---\ntype: character\nkind: pc\nclass: Fighter\nsubclass: Champion\nlevel: 3\nspecies: Goliath\nbackground: Soldier\nalignment: Lawful Neutral\nconcept: A retired siege-breaker who would like very much to stop breaking things.\nplayer: Alex\nhp: 28\nac: 18\ninit: 2\nspeed: 10.5 m\nperception: 13\nprof: 2\nstr: 17\ndex: 14\ncon: 14\nint: 8\nwis: 12\ncha: 10\nsource: DM Forge Character Library\nupdated: 2026-11-02\n---\n\n# Korg Ironhand\n\n*Level 3 Goliath Fighter (Champion) · Soldier · Lawful Neutral*\n\n**AC** 18 (Chain Mail + Shield) · **HP** 28 (3d10) · **Initiative** +2 · **Speed** 10.5 m · **Proficiency** +2\n\n| Str | Dex | Con | Int | Wis | Cha |\n|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|\n| 17 (+3) | 14 (+2) | 14 (+2) | 8 (−1) | 12 (+1) | 10 (+0) |\n\n**Saving Throws** Str +5, Dex +4  \n**Skills** Athletics +5, Intimidation +2, Perception +3, Survival +3  \n**Passive Perception** 13\n\n## Proficiencies\n\n- **Armor.** Light, Medium, and Heavy armor and Shields\n- **Weapons.** Simple and Martial weapons\n- **Tools.** One gaming set\n\n## Class resources\n\nSecond Wind: 2 · Weapon Mastery: 3\n\n## Features\n\n- **Fighting Style** _(Fighter 1)_. You have honed your martial prowess and gain a Fighting Style feat of your choice (see \"Feats\").\n- **Second Wind** _(Fighter 1)_. You have a limited well of physical and mental stamina that you can draw on.\n- **Weapon Mastery** _(Fighter 1)_. Your training with weapons allows you to use the mastery properties of three kinds of Simple or Martial weapons of your choice.\n- **Action Surge** _(Fighter 2)_. You can push yourself beyond your normal limits for a moment.\n- **Tactical Mind** _(Fighter 2)_. You have a mind for tactics on and off the battlefield.\n- **Fighter Subclass** _(Fighter 3)_. You gain a Fighter subclass of your choice.\n- **Improved Critical** _(Champion 3)_. Your attack rolls with weapons and Unarmed Strikes can score a Critical Hit on a roll of 19 or 20 on the d20.\n- **Remarkable Athlete** _(Champion 3)_. Thanks to your athleticism, you have Advantage on Initiative rolls and Strength (Athletics) checks.\n- **Giant Ancestry** _(Goliath)_. You are descended from Giants.\n- **Large Form** _(Goliath)_. Starting at character level 5, you can change your size to Large as a Bonus Action if you're in a big enough space.\n- **Powerful Build** _(Goliath)_. You have Advantage on any ability check you make to end the Grappled condition.\n- **Savage Attacker** _(Origin feat)_.\n\n## Equipment\n\n- Chain Mail\n- Greatsword\n- Flail\n- 8 Javelins\n- Dungeoneer's Pack\n- Shield\n- 4 GP\n\n## Basics\n\n**Alignment:** Lawful Neutral\n\n**Player:** Alex\n\n**One-line concept:** A retired siege-breaker who would like very much to stop breaking things.\n\n## Appearance and voice\n\n**Appearance:** Seven feet of scar tissue and politeness.\n\n## Personality\n\n**Personality trait:** I judge people by how they treat waiters and ferrymen.\n\n**Ideal:** Duty: someone has to hold the line.\n\n**Bond:** I owe my life to the medic who stitched me together at Harrow Gate.\n\n**Flaw:** I hold a grudge for far too long.\n\n---\n_Built with the SRD 5.2.1 (CC-BY 4.0). Includes material from the System Reference Document 5.2.1 (“SRD 5.2.1”) by Wizards of the Coast LLC, available at https://www.dndbeyond.com/srd. The SRD 5.2.1 is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License, available at https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode._\n\n<!-- dmforge:character {\"v\":1,\"kind\":\"pc\",\"name\":\"Korg Ironhand\",\"level\":3,\"cls\":\"Fighter\",\"sub\":\"Champion\",\"species\":\"Goliath\",\"speciesNote\":\"Hill Giant\",\"bg\":\"Soldier\",\"bgMode\":\"21\",\"bgA\":\"Str\",\"bgB\":\"Con\",\"method\":\"std\",\"base\":{\"Str\":15,\"Dex\":14,\"Con\":13,\"Wis\":12,\"Cha\":10,\"Int\":8},\"skills\":[\"Perception\",\"Survival\"],\"extraSkill\":\"\",\"extraFeat\":\"\",\"cantrips\":[],\"prepared\":[],\"kit\":\"A\",\"gear\":[\"Shield\"]} -->\n",
 "Sable Quickfoot": "---\ntype: character\nkind: pc\nclass: Ranger\nsubclass: Hunter\nlevel: 4\nspecies: Halfling\nbackground: Criminal\nalignment: Chaotic Good\nconcept: Smuggled medicine over the border for three winters and has opinions about border guards.\nplayer: Priya\nhp: 36\nac: 15\ninit: 3\nspeed: 9 m\nperception: 14\nprof: 2\nstr: 8\ndex: 17\ncon: 14\nint: 10\nwis: 14\ncha: 12\nsource: DM Forge Character Library\nupdated: 2026-11-02\n---\n\n# Sable Quickfoot\n\n*Level 4 Halfling Ranger (Hunter) · Criminal · Chaotic Good*\n\n**AC** 15 (Studded Leather Armor) · **HP** 36 (4d10) · **Initiative** +3 · **Speed** 9 m · **Proficiency** +2\n\n| Str | Dex | Con | Int | Wis | Cha |\n|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|\n| 8 (−1) | 17 (+3) | 14 (+2) | 10 (+0) | 14 (+2) | 12 (+1) |\n\n**Saving Throws** Str +1, Dex +5  \n**Skills** Animal Handling +4, Perception +4, Sleight of Hand +5, Stealth +5, Survival +4  \n**Passive Perception** 14\n\n## Proficiencies\n\n- **Armor.** Light and Medium armor and Shields\n- **Weapons.** Simple and Martial weapons\n- **Tools.** Thieves' Tools\n\n## Class resources\n\nFavored Enemy: 2\n\n## Features\n\n- **Favored Enemy** _(Ranger 1)_. You always have the *Hunter's Mark* spell prepared.\n- **Spellcasting** _(Ranger 1)_. You have learned to channel the magical essence of nature to cast spells.\n- **Weapon Mastery** _(Ranger 1)_. Your training with weapons allows you to use the mastery properties of two kinds of weapons of your choice with which you have proficiency, such as Longbows and Shortswords.\n- **Deft Explorer** _(Ranger 2)_. Thanks to your travels, you gain the following benefits.\n- **Fighting Style** _(Ranger 2)_. You gain a Fighting Style feat of your choice (see \"Feats\").\n- **Ranger Subclass** _(Ranger 3)_. You gain a Ranger subclass of your choice.\n- **Ability Score Improvement** _(Ranger 4)_. You gain the Ability Score Improvement feat (see \"Feats\") or another feat of your choice for which you qualify.\n- **Hunter's Lore** _(Hunter 3)_. You can call on the forces of nature to reveal certain strengths and weaknesses of your prey.\n- **Hunter's Prey** _(Hunter 3)_. You gain one of the following feature options of your choice.\n- **Brave** _(Halfling)_. You have Advantage on saving throws you make to avoid or end the Frightened condition.\n- **Halfling Nimbleness** _(Halfling)_. You can move through the space of any creature that is a size larger than you, but you can't stop in the same space.\n- **Luck** _(Halfling)_. When you roll a 1 on the d20 of a D20 Test, you can reroll the die, and you must use the new roll.\n- **Naturally Stealthy** _(Halfling)_. You can take the Hide action even when you are obscured only by a creature that is at least one size larger than you.\n- **Alert** _(Origin feat)_.\n\n## Spells\n\n**Spellcasting ability** Wis · **Spell save DC** 12 · **Spell attack** +4\n\n**Slots** L1: 3\n\n**Prepared** [[Hunter's Mark]], [[Cure Wounds]], [[Goodberry]], [[Alarm]], [[Animal Friendship]]\n\n## Equipment\n\n- Studded Leather Armor\n- Scimitar\n- Shortsword\n- Longbow\n- 20 Arrows\n- Quiver\n- Druidic Focus (sprig of mistletoe)\n- Explorer's Pack\n- 7 GP\n\n## Basics\n\n**Alignment:** Chaotic Good\n\n**Player:** Priya\n\n**One-line concept:** Smuggled medicine over the border for three winters and has opinions about border guards.\n\n## Appearance and voice\n\n**Appearance:** Mud to the knees and a grin to the ears.\n\n**Voice:** Whispers even when nobody is listening.\n\n## Personality\n\n**Personality trait:** I turn everything into a bet.\n\n**Ideal:** Freedom: chains are meant to be broken.\n\n**Bond:** A younger sibling who does not know what I do for a living.\n\n**Flaw:** I cannot resist a locked door.\n\n---\n_Built with the SRD 5.2.1 (CC-BY 4.0). Includes material from the System Reference Document 5.2.1 (“SRD 5.2.1”) by Wizards of the Coast LLC, available at https://www.dndbeyond.com/srd. The SRD 5.2.1 is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License, available at https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode._\n\n<!-- dmforge:character {\"v\":1,\"kind\":\"pc\",\"name\":\"Sable Quickfoot\",\"level\":4,\"cls\":\"Ranger\",\"sub\":\"Hunter\",\"species\":\"Halfling\",\"speciesNote\":\"Lightfoot\",\"bg\":\"Criminal\",\"bgMode\":\"21\",\"bgA\":\"Dex\",\"bgB\":\"Con\",\"method\":\"std\",\"base\":{\"Dex\":15,\"Wis\":14,\"Con\":13,\"Cha\":12,\"Int\":10,\"Str\":8},\"skills\":[\"Perception\",\"Survival\",\"Animal Handling\"],\"extraSkill\":\"\",\"extraFeat\":\"\",\"cantrips\":[],\"prepared\":[\"Hunter's Mark\",\"Cure Wounds\",\"Goodberry\",\"Alarm\",\"Animal Friendship\"],\"kit\":\"A\",\"gear\":[]} -->\n",
 "Seraphine Voss": "---\ntype: character\nkind: pc\nclass: Warlock\nsubclass: Fiend Patron\nlevel: 5\nspecies: Tiefling\nbackground: Criminal\nalignment: Chaotic Neutral\nconcept: Made a deal at sixteen. Reads the small print now.\nplayer: Jamie\nhp: 38\nac: 13\ninit: 2\nspeed: 9 m\nperception: 11\nprof: 3\nstr: 8\ndex: 14\ncon: 14\nint: 10\nwis: 12\ncha: 15\nsource: DM Forge Character Library\nupdated: 2026-11-02\n---\n\n# Seraphine Voss\n\n*Level 5 Tiefling Warlock (Fiend Patron) · Criminal · Chaotic Neutral*\n\n**AC** 13 (Leather Armor) · **HP** 38 (5d8) · **Initiative** +2 · **Speed** 9 m · **Proficiency** +3\n\n| Str | Dex | Con | Int | Wis | Cha |\n|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|\n| 8 (−1) | 14 (+2) | 14 (+2) | 10 (+0) | 12 (+1) | 15 (+2) |\n\n**Saving Throws** Wis +4, Cha +5  \n**Skills** Deception +5, Intimidation +5, Sleight of Hand +5, Stealth +5  \n**Passive Perception** 11\n\n## Proficiencies\n\n- **Armor.** Light armor\n- **Weapons.** Simple weapons\n- **Tools.** Thieves' Tools\n\n## Class resources\n\nEldritch Invocations: 5\n\n## Features\n\n- **Eldritch Invocations** _(Warlock 1)_. You have unearthed Eldritch Invocations, pieces of forbidden knowledge that imbue you with an abiding magical ability or other lessons.\n- **Pact Magic** _(Warlock 1)_. Through occult ceremony, you have formed a pact with a mysterious entity to gain magical powers.\n- **Magic Cunning** _(Warlock 2)_. You can perform an esoteric rite for 1 minute.\n- **Warlock Subclass** _(Warlock 3)_. You gain a Warlock subclass of your choice.\n- **Ability Score Improvement** _(Warlock 4)_. You gain the Ability Score Improvement feat (see \"Feats\") or another feat of your choice for which you qualify.\n- **Dark One's Blessing** _(Fiend Patron 3)_. When you reduce an enemy to 0 Hit Points, you gain Temporary Hit Points equal to your Charisma modifier plus your Warlock level (minimum of 1 Temporary Hit Point).\n- **Fiend Spells** _(Fiend Patron 3)_. The magic of your patron ensures you always have certain spells ready; when you reach a Warlock level specified in the Fiend Spells table, you thereafter always have the listed spells…\n- **Darkvision** _(Tiefling)_. You have Darkvision with a range of 60 feet.\n- **Fiendish Legacy** _(Tiefling)_. You are the recipient of a legacy that grants you supernatural abilities.\n- **Otherworldly Presence** _(Tiefling)_. You know the *Thaumaturgy* cantrip.\n- **Alert** _(Origin feat)_.\n\n## Spells\n\n**Spellcasting ability** Int · **Spell save DC** 11 · **Spell attack** +3\n\n**Slots** 2 × level 3 (Pact Magic)\n\n**Cantrips** [[Eldritch Blast]], [[Mage Hand]], [[Chill Touch]]\n\n**Prepared** [[Hex]], [[Hold Person]], [[Misty Step]], [[Counterspell]], [[Dispel Magic]], [[Fear]]\n\n## Equipment\n\n- Leather Armor\n- Sickle\n- 2 Daggers\n- Arcane Focus (orb)\n- Book (occult lore)\n- Scholar's Pack\n- 15 GP\n\n## Basics\n\n**Alignment:** Chaotic Neutral\n\n**Player:** Jamie\n\n**One-line concept:** Made a deal at sixteen. Reads the small print now.\n\n## Appearance and voice\n\n**Appearance:** Horns filed down, one earring for every debt cleared.\n\n## Personality\n\n**Personality trait:** I speak to animals as if they were people.\n\n**Ideal:** Redemption: nobody is beyond a second chance.\n\n**Bond:** I owe a favour to someone dangerous.\n\n**Flaw:** I bargain with things I should not.\n\n---\n_Built with the SRD 5.2.1 (CC-BY 4.0). Includes material from the System Reference Document 5.2.1 (“SRD 5.2.1”) by Wizards of the Coast LLC, available at https://www.dndbeyond.com/srd. The SRD 5.2.1 is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License, available at https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode._\n\n<!-- dmforge:character {\"v\":1,\"kind\":\"pc\",\"name\":\"Seraphine Voss\",\"level\":5,\"cls\":\"Warlock\",\"sub\":\"Fiend Patron\",\"species\":\"Tiefling\",\"speciesNote\":\"Infernal\",\"bg\":\"Criminal\",\"bgMode\":\"21\",\"bgA\":\"Cha\",\"bgB\":\"Dex\",\"method\":\"std\",\"base\":{\"Cha\":15,\"Con\":14,\"Dex\":13,\"Wis\":12,\"Int\":10,\"Str\":8},\"skills\":[\"Deception\",\"Intimidation\"],\"extraSkill\":\"\",\"extraFeat\":\"\",\"cantrips\":[\"Eldritch Blast\",\"Mage Hand\",\"Chill Touch\"],\"prepared\":[\"Hex\",\"Hold Person\",\"Misty Step\",\"Counterspell\",\"Dispel Magic\",\"Fear\"],\"kit\":\"A\",\"gear\":[]} -->\n",
 "Dorn Ashfield": "---\ntype: character\nkind: pc\nclass: Barbarian\nsubclass: Path of the Berserker\nlevel: 6\nspecies: Orc\nbackground: Soldier\nalignment: Chaotic Good\nconcept: Gentle with children and furniture. Terrifying otherwise.\nplayer: Morgan\nhp: 59\nac: 13\ninit: 1\nspeed: 9 m\nperception: 11\nprof: 3\nstr: 17\ndex: 13\ncon: 15\nint: 8\nwis: 12\ncha: 10\nsource: DM Forge Character Library\nupdated: 2026-11-02\n---\n\n# Dorn Ashfield\n\n*Level 6 Orc Barbarian (Path of the Berserker) · Soldier · Chaotic Good*\n\n**AC** 13 (Unarmored Defense) · **HP** 59 (6d12) · **Initiative** +1 · **Speed** 9 m · **Proficiency** +3\n\n| Str | Dex | Con | Int | Wis | Cha |\n|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|\n| 17 (+3) | 13 (+1) | 15 (+2) | 8 (−1) | 12 (+1) | 10 (+0) |\n\n**Saving Throws** Str +6, Con +5  \n**Skills** Animal Handling +4, Athletics +6, Intimidation +3, Survival +4  \n**Passive Perception** 11\n\n## Proficiencies\n\n- **Armor.** Light and Medium armor and Shields\n- **Weapons.** Simple and Martial weapons\n- **Tools.** One gaming set\n\n## Class resources\n\nRage Damage: 2 · Rages: 4 · Weapon Mastery: 3\n\n## Features\n\n- **Rage** _(Barbarian 1)_. You can imbue yourself with a primal power called Rage, a force that grants you extraordinary might and resilience.\n- **Unarmored Defense** _(Barbarian 1)_. While you aren't wearing any armor, your base Armor Class equals 10 plus your Dexterity and Constitution modifiers.\n- **Weapon Mastery** _(Barbarian 1)_. Your training with weapons allows you to use the mastery properties of two kinds of Simple or Martial Melee weapons of your choice, such as Greataxes and Handaxes.\n- **Danger Sense** _(Barbarian 2)_. You gain an uncanny sense of when things aren't as they should be, giving you an edge when you dodge perils.\n- **Reckless Attack** _(Barbarian 2)_. You can throw aside all concern for defense to attack with increased ferocity.\n- **Barbarian Subclass** _(Barbarian 3)_. You gain a Barbarian subclass of your choice.\n- **Primal Knowledge** _(Barbarian 3)_. You gain proficiency in another skill of your choice from the skill list available to Barbarians at level 1.\n- **Ability Score Improvement** _(Barbarian 4)_. You gain the Ability Score Improvement feat (see \"Feats\") or another feat of your choice for which you qualify.\n- **Extra Attack** _(Barbarian 5)_. You can attack twice instead of once whenever you take the Attack action on your turn.\n- **Fast Movement** _(Barbarian 5)_. Your speed increases by 10 feet while you aren't wearing Heavy armor.\n- **Frenzy** _(Path of the Berserker 3)_. If you use Reckless Attack while your Rage is active, you deal extra damage to the first target you hit on your turn with a Strength-based attack.\n- **Mindless Rage** _(Path of the Berserker 6)_. You have Immunity to the Charmed and Frightened conditions while your Rage is active.\n- **Adrenaline Rush** _(Orc)_. You can take the Dash action as a Bonus Action.\n- **Darkvision** _(Orc)_. You have Darkvision with a range of 120 feet.\n- **Relentless Endurance** _(Orc)_. When you are reduced to 0 Hit Points but not killed outright, you can drop to 1 Hit Point instead.\n- **Savage Attacker** _(Origin feat)_.\n\n## Equipment\n\n- Greataxe\n- 4 Handaxes\n- Explorer's Pack\n- 15 GP\n\n## Basics\n\n**Alignment:** Chaotic Good\n\n**Player:** Morgan\n\n**One-line concept:** Gentle with children and furniture. Terrifying otherwise.\n\n---\n_Built with the SRD 5.2.1 (CC-BY 4.0). Includes material from the System Reference Document 5.2.1 (“SRD 5.2.1”) by Wizards of the Coast LLC, available at https://www.dndbeyond.com/srd. The SRD 5.2.1 is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License, available at https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode._\n\n<!-- dmforge:character {\"v\":1,\"kind\":\"pc\",\"name\":\"Dorn Ashfield\",\"level\":6,\"cls\":\"Barbarian\",\"sub\":\"Path of the Berserker\",\"species\":\"Orc\",\"speciesNote\":\"\",\"bg\":\"Soldier\",\"bgMode\":\"21\",\"bgA\":\"Str\",\"bgB\":\"Con\",\"method\":\"std\",\"base\":{\"Str\":15,\"Con\":14,\"Dex\":13,\"Wis\":12,\"Cha\":10,\"Int\":8},\"skills\":[\"Survival\",\"Animal Handling\"],\"extraSkill\":\"\",\"extraFeat\":\"\",\"cantrips\":[],\"prepared\":[],\"kit\":\"A\",\"gear\":[]} -->\n",
 "Mira Vell": "---\ntype: character\nkind: npc\nclass: Rogue\nlevel: 2\nspecies: Human\nbackground: Criminal\nalignment: Neutral\nconcept: Buys what falls off barges and sells what people forgot they knew.\nhp: 17\nac: 14\ninit: 3\nspeed: 9 m\nperception: 13\nprof: 2\nstr: 8\ndex: 17\ncon: 14\nint: 11\nwis: 13\ncha: 12\nsource: DM Forge Character Library\nupdated: 2026-11-02\n---\n\n# Mira Vell\n\n*Level 2 Human Rogue · Criminal · Neutral*\n\n**AC** 14 (Leather Armor) · **HP** 17 (2d8) · **Initiative** +3 · **Speed** 9 m · **Proficiency** +2\n\n| Str | Dex | Con | Int | Wis | Cha |\n|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|\n| 8 (−1) | 17 (+3) | 14 (+2) | 11 (+0) | 13 (+1) | 12 (+1) |\n\n**Saving Throws** Dex +5, Int +2  \n**Skills** Deception +3, Investigation +2, Perception +3, Persuasion +3, Sleight of Hand +5, Stealth +5  \n**Passive Perception** 13\n\n## Proficiencies\n\n- **Armor.** Light armor\n- **Weapons.** Simple weapons and Martial weapons that have the Finesse or Light property\n- **Tools.** Thieves' Tools; Thieves' Tools\n\n## Class resources\n\nSneak Attack: 1d6\n\n## Features\n\n- **Expertise** _(Rogue 1)_. You gain Expertise in two of your skill proficiencies of your choice.\n- **Sneak Attack** _(Rogue 1)_. You know how to strike subtly and exploit a foe's distraction.\n- **Thieves' Cant** _(Rogue 1)_. You picked up various languages in the communities where you plied your roguish talents.\n- **Weapon Mastery** _(Rogue 1)_. Your training with weapons allows you to use the mastery properties of two kinds of weapons of your choice with which you have proficiency, such as Daggers and Shortbows.\n- **Cunning Action** _(Rogue 2)_. Your quick thinking and agility allow you to move and act quickly.\n- **Resourceful** _(Human)_. You gain Heroic Inspiration whenever you finish a Long Rest.\n- **Skillful** _(Human)_. You gain proficiency in one skill of your choice.\n- **Versatile** _(Human)_. You gain an Origin feat of your choice (see \"Feats\").\n- **Alert** _(Origin feat)_.\n\n## Equipment\n\n- Leather Armor\n- 2 Daggers\n- Shortsword\n- Shortbow\n- 20 Arrows\n- Quiver\n- Thieves' Tools\n- Burglar's Pack\n- 8 GP\n\n## Basics\n\n**Alignment:** Neutral\n\n**Role in your world:** Fence and information broker\n\n**One-line concept:** Buys what falls off barges and sells what people forgot they knew.\n\n## Appearance and voice\n\n**Appearance:** Always dressed one shade too well for the district.\n\n**Voice:** Warm, unhurried, with a laugh behind every sentence.\n\n## Running this NPC\n\n**What they want:** A boat, and a reason to leave.\n\n**What they know:** Who moved the bells downriver, and what it cost.\n\n**Their secret:** Works for the Ember Court as well as against it.\n\n**How to play them (voice, tics):** Offers tea first. Never answers the question that was asked.\n\n---\n_Built with the SRD 5.2.1 (CC-BY 4.0). Includes material from the System Reference Document 5.2.1 (“SRD 5.2.1”) by Wizards of the Coast LLC, available at https://www.dndbeyond.com/srd. The SRD 5.2.1 is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License, available at https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode._\n\n<!-- dmforge:character {\"v\":1,\"kind\":\"npc\",\"name\":\"Mira Vell\",\"level\":2,\"cls\":\"Rogue\",\"sub\":\"Thief\",\"species\":\"Human\",\"speciesNote\":\"\",\"bg\":\"Criminal\",\"bgMode\":\"21\",\"bgA\":\"Dex\",\"bgB\":\"Int\",\"method\":\"std\",\"base\":{\"Dex\":15,\"Con\":14,\"Wis\":13,\"Cha\":12,\"Int\":10,\"Str\":8},\"skills\":[\"Deception\",\"Persuasion\",\"Perception\",\"Investigation\"],\"extraSkill\":\"\",\"extraFeat\":\"\",\"cantrips\":[],\"prepared\":[],\"kit\":\"A\",\"gear\":[]} -->\n",
 "Old Haldor": "---\ntype: character\nkind: npc\nclass: Cleric\nsubclass: Life Domain\nlevel: 6\nspecies: Dwarf\nbackground: Acolyte\nalignment: Lawful Good\nconcept: Has buried three priests and is not planning on a fourth.\nhp: 45\nac: 16\ninit: 1\nspeed: 9 m\nperception: 13\nprof: 3\nstr: 8\ndex: 13\ncon: 14\nint: 11\nwis: 17\ncha: 12\nsource: DM Forge Character Library\nupdated: 2026-11-02\n---\n\n# Old Haldor\n\n*Level 6 Dwarf Cleric (Life Domain) · Acolyte · Lawful Good*\n\n**AC** 16 (Chain Shirt + Shield) · **HP** 45 (6d8) · **Initiative** +1 · **Speed** 9 m · **Proficiency** +3\n\n| Str | Dex | Con | Int | Wis | Cha |\n|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|\n| 8 (−1) | 13 (+1) | 14 (+2) | 11 (+0) | 17 (+3) | 12 (+1) |\n\n**Saving Throws** Wis +6, Cha +4  \n**Skills** History +3, Insight +6, Medicine +6, Religion +3  \n**Passive Perception** 13\n\n## Proficiencies\n\n- **Armor.** Light and Medium armor and Shields\n- **Weapons.** Simple weapons\n- **Tools.** Calligrapher's Supplies\n\n## Class resources\n\nChannel Divinity: 3\n\n## Features\n\n- **Divine Order** _(Cleric 1)_. You have dedicated yourself to one of the following sacred roles of your choice.\n- **Spellcasting** _(Cleric 1)_. You have learned to cast spells through prayer and meditation.\n- **Channel Divinity** _(Cleric 2)_. You can channel divine energy directly from the Outer Planes to fuel magical effects.\n- **Cleric Subclasses** _(Cleric 3)_. You gain a Cleric subclass of your choice.\n- **Ability Score Improvement** _(Cleric 4)_. You gain the Ability Score Improvement feat (see \"Feats\") or another feat of your choice for which you qualify.\n- **Sear Undead** _(Cleric 5)_. Whenever you use Turn Undead, you can roll a number of d8s equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum of 1d8) and add the rolls together.\n- **Disciple of Life** _(Life Domain 3)_. When a spell you cast with a spell slot restores Hit Points to a creature, that creature regains additional Hit Points on the turn you cast the spell.\n- **Life Domain Spells** _(Life Domain 3)_. Your connection to this divine domain ensures you always have certain spells ready.\n- **Preserve Life** _(Life Domain 3)_. As a Magic action, you present your Holy Symbol and expend a use of your Channel Divinity to evoke healing energy that can restore a number of Hit Points equal to five times your Cleric…\n- **Blessed Healer** _(Life Domain 6)_. The healing spells you cast on others heal you as well.\n- **Darkvision** _(Dwarf)_. You have Darkvision with a range of 120 feet.\n- **Dwarven Resilience** _(Dwarf)_. You have Resistance to Poison damage.\n- **Dwarven Toughness** _(Dwarf)_. Your Hit Point maximum increases by 1, and it increases by 1 again whenever you gain a level.\n- **Stonecunning** _(Dwarf)_. As a Bonus Action, you gain Tremorsense with a range of 60 feet for 10 minutes.\n- **Magic Initiate (Cleric)** _(Origin feat)_.\n\n## Spells\n\n**Spellcasting ability** Wis · **Spell save DC** 14 · **Spell attack** +6\n\n**Slots** L1: 4 · L2: 3 · L3: 3\n\n**Cantrips** [[Guidance]], [[Sacred Flame]], [[Light]], [[Spare the Dying]]\n\n**Prepared** [[Bless]], [[Cure Wounds]], [[Guiding Bolt]], [[Spiritual Weapon]], [[Revivify]], [[Aid]], [[Lesser Restoration]], [[Spirit Guardians]], [[Animate Dead]], [[Beacon of Hope]]\n\n## Equipment\n\n- Chain Shirt\n- Shield\n- Mace\n- Holy Symbol\n- Priest's Pack\n- 7 GP\n\n## Basics\n\n**Alignment:** Lawful Good\n\n**Role in your world:** Keeper of the shrine records\n\n**One-line concept:** Has buried three priests and is not planning on a fourth.\n\n## Appearance and voice\n\n**Voice:** Low and gravelly, with long pauses.\n\n## Running this NPC\n\n**What they want:** To see the shrine bells ring one more time.\n\n**What they know:** The bells were never stolen: they were taken down in the night with a ritual lift.\n\n**Their secret:** Helped, years ago, and has never forgiven himself.\n\n**Where to find them:** The shrine records room, or the Cinder & Crown after dusk.\n\n---\n_Built with the SRD 5.2.1 (CC-BY 4.0). Includes material from the System Reference Document 5.2.1 (“SRD 5.2.1”) by Wizards of the Coast LLC, available at https://www.dndbeyond.com/srd. The SRD 5.2.1 is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License, available at https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode._\n\n<!-- dmforge:character {\"v\":1,\"kind\":\"npc\",\"name\":\"Old Haldor\",\"level\":6,\"cls\":\"Cleric\",\"sub\":\"Life Domain\",\"species\":\"Dwarf\",\"speciesNote\":\"Stonecunning\",\"bg\":\"Acolyte\",\"bgMode\":\"21\",\"bgA\":\"Wis\",\"bgB\":\"Int\",\"method\":\"std\",\"base\":{\"Wis\":15,\"Con\":14,\"Dex\":13,\"Cha\":12,\"Int\":10,\"Str\":8},\"skills\":[\"Medicine\",\"History\"],\"extraSkill\":\"\",\"extraFeat\":\"\",\"cantrips\":[\"Guidance\",\"Sacred Flame\",\"Light\",\"Spare the Dying\"],\"prepared\":[\"Bless\",\"Cure Wounds\",\"Guiding Bolt\",\"Spiritual Weapon\",\"Revivify\",\"Aid\",\"Lesser Restoration\",\"Spirit Guardians\",\"Animate Dead\",\"Beacon of Hope\"],\"kit\":\"A\",\"gear\":[]} -->\n",
 "Brother Anselm": "---\ntype: character\nkind: npc\nclass: Paladin\nsubclass: Oath of Devotion\nlevel: 8\nspecies: Human\nbackground: Soldier\nalignment: Lawful Good\nconcept: Arrived a week after the bells vanished and has not said who sent him.\nhp: 60\nac: 18\ninit: 1\nspeed: 9 m\nperception: 10\nprof: 3\nstr: 17\ndex: 13\ncon: 13\nint: 8\nwis: 10\ncha: 14\nsource: DM Forge Character Library\nupdated: 2026-11-02\n---\n\n# Brother Anselm\n\n*Level 8 Human Paladin (Oath of Devotion) · Soldier · Lawful Good*\n\n**AC** 18 (Chain Mail + Shield) · **HP** 60 (8d10) · **Initiative** +1 · **Speed** 9 m · **Proficiency** +3\n\n| Str | Dex | Con | Int | Wis | Cha |\n|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|\n| 17 (+3) | 13 (+1) | 13 (+1) | 8 (−1) | 10 (+0) | 14 (+2) |\n\n**Saving Throws** Wis +3, Cha +5  \n**Skills** Athletics +6, Insight +3, Intimidation +5, Persuasion +5  \n**Passive Perception** 10\n\n## Proficiencies\n\n- **Armor.** Light, Medium, and Heavy armor and Shields\n- **Weapons.** Simple and Martial weapons\n- **Tools.** One gaming set\n\n## Class resources\n\nChannel Divinity: 2\n\n## Features\n\n- **Lay On Hands** _(Paladin 1)_. Your blessed touch can heal wounds.\n- **Spellcasting** _(Paladin 1)_. You have learned to cast spells through prayer and meditation.\n- **Weapon Mastery** _(Paladin 1)_. Your training with weapons allows you to use the mastery properties of two kinds of weapons of your choice with which you have proficiency, such as Longswords and Javelins.\n- **Fighting Style** _(Paladin 2)_. You gain a Fighting Style feat of your choice (see \"Feats\" for feats).\n- **Paladin's Smite** _(Paladin 2)_. You always have the *Divine Smite* spell prepared.\n- **Channel Divinity** _(Paladin 3)_. You can channel divine energy directly from the Outer Planes, using it to fuel magical effects.\n- **Paladin Subclass** _(Paladin 3)_. You gain a Paladin subclass of your choice.\n- **Ability Score Improvement** _(Paladin 4)_. You gain the Ability Score Improvement feat (see \"Feats\") or another feat of your choice for which you qualify.\n- **Extra Attack** _(Paladin 5)_. You can attack twice instead of once whenever you take the Attack action on your turn.\n- **Faithful Steed** _(Paladin 5)_. You can call on the aid of an otherworldly steed.\n- **Aura of Protection** _(Paladin 6)_. You radiate a protective, unseeable aura in a 10-foot Emanation that originates from you.\n- **Ability Score Improvement** _(Paladin 8)_. You gain the Ability Score Improvement feat (see \"Feats\") or another feat of your choice for which you qualify.\n- **Oath of Devotion Spells** _(Oath of Devotion 3)_. The magic of your oath ensures you always have certain spells ready; when you reach a Paladin level specified in the Oath of Devotion Spells table, you thereafter always have the listed…\n- **Sacred Weapon** _(Oath of Devotion 3)_. When you take the Attack action, you can expend one use of your Channel Divinity to imbue one Melee weapon that you are holding with positive energy.\n- **Aura of Devotion** _(Oath of Devotion 7)_. You and your allies have Immunity to the Charmed condition while in your Aura of Protection.\n- **Resourceful** _(Human)_. You gain Heroic Inspiration whenever you finish a Long Rest.\n- **Skillful** _(Human)_. You gain proficiency in one skill of your choice.\n- **Versatile** _(Human)_. You gain an Origin feat of your choice (see \"Feats\").\n- **Savage Attacker** _(Origin feat)_.\n\n## Spells\n\n**Spellcasting ability** Cha · **Spell save DC** 13 · **Spell attack** +5\n\n**Slots** L1: 4 · L2: 3\n\n**Prepared** [[Bless]], [[Command]], [[Shield of Faith]], [[Find Steed]], [[Aid]], [[Lesser Restoration]], [[Gentle Repose]]\n\n## Equipment\n\n- Chain Mail\n- Shield\n- Longsword\n- 6 Javelins\n- Holy Symbol\n- Priest's Pack\n- 9 GP\n\n## Basics\n\n**Alignment:** Lawful Good\n\n**Role in your world:** Wandering oath-keeper\n\n**One-line concept:** Arrived a week after the bells vanished and has not said who sent him.\n\n## Appearance and voice\n\n**Voice:** Formal, as if reading from a script.\n\n## Running this NPC\n\n**What they want:** To stand in the Sunken Chapel at midnight.\n\n**What they know:** Calder was once his student.\n\n**Their secret:** Was sent by the Quiet Flame to judge Calder, not to help him.\n\n---\n_Built with the SRD 5.2.1 (CC-BY 4.0). Includes material from the System Reference Document 5.2.1 (“SRD 5.2.1”) by Wizards of the Coast LLC, available at https://www.dndbeyond.com/srd. The SRD 5.2.1 is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License, available at https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode._\n\n<!-- dmforge:character {\"v\":1,\"kind\":\"npc\",\"name\":\"Brother Anselm\",\"level\":8,\"cls\":\"Paladin\",\"sub\":\"Oath of Devotion\",\"species\":\"Human\",\"speciesNote\":\"\",\"bg\":\"Soldier\",\"bgMode\":\"21\",\"bgA\":\"Str\",\"bgB\":\"Dex\",\"method\":\"std\",\"base\":{\"Str\":15,\"Cha\":14,\"Con\":13,\"Dex\":12,\"Wis\":10,\"Int\":8},\"skills\":[\"Persuasion\",\"Insight\"],\"extraSkill\":\"\",\"extraFeat\":\"\",\"cantrips\":[],\"prepared\":[\"Bless\",\"Command\",\"Shield of Faith\",\"Find Steed\",\"Aid\",\"Lesser Restoration\",\"Gentle Repose\"],\"kit\":\"A\",\"gear\":[]} -->\n",
 "Pip Underwood": "---\ntype: character\nkind: npc\nclass: Bard\nlevel: 1\nspecies: Halfling\nbackground: Criminal\nalignment: Chaotic Good\nconcept: Sings while mucking out. Knows every hoofbeat on the Orchard Road.\nhp: 10\nac: 13\ninit: 2\nspeed: 9 m\nperception: 11\nprof: 2\nstr: 8\ndex: 15\ncon: 15\nint: 10\nwis: 12\ncha: 15\nsource: DM Forge Character Library\nupdated: 2026-11-02\n---\n\n# Pip Underwood\n\n*Level 1 Halfling Bard · Criminal · Chaotic Good*\n\n**AC** 13 (Leather Armor) · **HP** 10 (1d8) · **Initiative** +2 · **Speed** 9 m · **Proficiency** +2\n\n| Str | Dex | Con | Int | Wis | Cha |\n|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|\n| 8 (−1) | 15 (+2) | 15 (+2) | 10 (+0) | 12 (+1) | 15 (+2) |\n\n**Saving Throws** Dex +4, Cha +4  \n**Skills** Deception +4, Performance +4, Persuasion +4, Sleight of Hand +4, Stealth +4  \n**Passive Perception** 11\n\n## Proficiencies\n\n- **Armor.** Light armor\n- **Weapons.** Simple weapons\n- **Tools.** Choose 3 Musical Instruments; Thieves' Tools\n\n## Class resources\n\nBardic Die: D6\n\n## Features\n\n- **Bardic Inspiration** _(Bard 1)_. You can supernaturally inspire others through words, music, or dance.\n- **Spellcasting** _(Bard 1)_. You have learned to cast spells through your bardic arts.\n- **Brave** _(Halfling)_. You have Advantage on saving throws you make to avoid or end the Frightened condition.\n- **Halfling Nimbleness** _(Halfling)_. You can move through the space of any creature that is a size larger than you, but you can't stop in the same space.\n- **Luck** _(Halfling)_. When you roll a 1 on the d20 of a D20 Test, you can reroll the die, and you must use the new roll.\n- **Naturally Stealthy** _(Halfling)_. You can take the Hide action even when you are obscured only by a creature that is at least one size larger than you.\n- **Alert** _(Origin feat)_.\n\n## Spells\n\n**Spellcasting ability** Cha · **Spell save DC** 12 · **Spell attack** +4\n\n**Slots** L1: 2\n\n**Cantrips** [[Vicious Mockery]], [[Mage Hand]]\n\n**Prepared** [[Healing Word]], [[Faerie Fire]], [[Animal Friendship]], [[Bane]]\n\n## Equipment\n\n- Leather Armor\n- 2 Daggers\n- Musical Instrument of your choice\n- Entertainer's Pack\n- 19 GP\n\n## Basics\n\n**Alignment:** Chaotic Good\n\n**Role in your world:** Stable boy at the Cinder & Crown\n\n**One-line concept:** Sings while mucking out. Knows every hoofbeat on the Orchard Road.\n\n---\n_Built with the SRD 5.2.1 (CC-BY 4.0). Includes material from the System Reference Document 5.2.1 (“SRD 5.2.1”) by Wizards of the Coast LLC, available at https://www.dndbeyond.com/srd. The SRD 5.2.1 is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License, available at https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode._\n\n<!-- dmforge:character {\"v\":1,\"kind\":\"npc\",\"name\":\"Pip Underwood\",\"level\":1,\"cls\":\"Bard\",\"sub\":\"College of Lore\",\"species\":\"Halfling\",\"speciesNote\":\"\",\"bg\":\"Criminal\",\"bgMode\":\"21\",\"bgA\":\"Dex\",\"bgB\":\"Con\",\"method\":\"std\",\"base\":{\"Cha\":15,\"Con\":14,\"Dex\":13,\"Wis\":12,\"Int\":10,\"Str\":8},\"skills\":[\"Performance\",\"Persuasion\",\"Deception\"],\"extraSkill\":\"\",\"extraFeat\":\"\",\"cantrips\":[\"Vicious Mockery\",\"Mage Hand\"],\"prepared\":[\"Healing Word\",\"Faerie Fire\",\"Animal Friendship\",\"Bane\"],\"kit\":\"A\",\"gear\":[]} -->\n",
 "Archmage Vaelith": "---\ntype: character\nkind: npc\nclass: Wizard\nsubclass: Evoker\nlevel: 20\nspecies: Elf\nbackground: Sage\nalignment: Lawful Neutral\nconcept: Has been waiting at the top of a tower for someone to ask the right question.\nhp: 122\nac: 11\ninit: 1\nspeed: 9 m\nperception: 11\nprof: 6\nstr: 8\ndex: 13\ncon: 15\nint: 17\nwis: 12\ncha: 10\nsource: DM Forge Character Library\nupdated: 2026-11-02\n---\n\n# Archmage Vaelith\n\n*Level 20 Elf Wizard (Evoker) · Sage · Lawful Neutral*\n\n**AC** 11 (No armour) · **HP** 122 (20d6) · **Initiative** +1 · **Speed** 9 m · **Proficiency** +6\n\n| Str | Dex | Con | Int | Wis | Cha |\n|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|\n| 8 (−1) | 13 (+1) | 15 (+2) | 17 (+3) | 12 (+1) | 10 (+0) |\n\n**Saving Throws** Int +9, Wis +7  \n**Skills** Arcana +9, History +9, Insight +7, Investigation +9  \n**Passive Perception** 11\n\n## Proficiencies\n\n- **Weapons.** Simple weapons\n- **Tools.** Calligrapher's Supplies\n\n## Features\n\n- **Arcane Recovery** _(Wizard 1)_. You can regain some of your magical energy by studying your spellbook.\n- **Ritual Adept** _(Wizard 1)_. You can cast any spell as a Ritual if that spell has the Ritual tag and the spell is in your spellbook.\n- **Spellcasting** _(Wizard 1)_. As a student of arcane magic, you have learned to cast spells.\n- **Scholar** _(Wizard 2)_. While studying magic, you also specialized in another field of study.\n- **Wizard Subclass** _(Wizard 3)_. You gain a Wizard subclass of your choice.\n- **Ability Score Improvement** _(Wizard 4)_. You gain the Ability Score Improvement feat (see \"Feats\") or another feat of your choice for which you qualify.\n- **Memorize Spell** _(Wizard 5)_. Whenever you finish a Short Rest, you can study your spellbook and replace one of the level 1+ Wizard spells you have prepared for your Spellcasting feature with another level 1+ spell…\n- **Ability Score Improvement** _(Wizard 8)_. You gain the Ability Score Improvement feat (see \"Feats\") or another feat of your choice for which you qualify.\n- **Ability Score Improvement** _(Wizard 12)_. You gain the Ability Score Improvement feat (see \"Feats\") or another feat of your choice for which you qualify.\n- **Ability Score Improvement** _(Wizard 16)_. You gain the Ability Score Improvement feat (see \"Feats\") or another feat of your choice for which you qualify.\n- **Spell Mastery** _(Wizard 18)_. You have achieved such mastery over certain spells that you can cast them at will.\n- **Epic Boon** _(Wizard 19)_. You gain an Epic Boon feat (see \"Feats\") or another feat of your choice for which you qualify.\n- **Signature Spells** _(Wizard 20)_. Choose two level 3 spells in your spellbook as your signature spells.\n- **Evocation Savant** _(Evoker 3)_. Choose two Wizard spells from the Evocation school, each of which must be no higher than level 2, and add them to your spellbook for free.\n- **Potent Cantrip** _(Evoker 3)_. Your damaging cantrips affect even creatures that avoid the brunt of the effect.\n- **Sculpt Spells** _(Evoker 6)_. You can create pockets of relative safety within the effects of your evocations.\n- **Empowered Evocation** _(Evoker 10)_. Whenever you cast a Wizard spell from the Evocation school, you can add your Intelligence modifier to one damage roll of that spell.\n- **Overchannel** _(Evoker 14)_. You can increase the power of your spells.\n- **Darkvision** _(Elf)_. You have Darkvision with a range of 60 feet.\n- **Elven Lineage** _(Elf)_. You are part of a lineage that grants you supernatural abilities.\n- **Fey Ancestry** _(Elf)_. You have Advantage on saving throws you make to avoid or end the Charmed condition.\n- **Keen Senses** _(Elf)_. You have proficiency in the Insight, Perception, or Survival skill.\n- **Trance** _(Elf)_. You don't need to sleep, and magic can't put you to sleep.\n- **Magic Initiate (Wizard)** _(Origin feat)_.\n\n## Spells\n\n**Spellcasting ability** Int · **Spell save DC** 17 · **Spell attack** +9\n\n**Slots** L1: 4 · L2: 3 · L3: 3 · L4: 3 · L5: 3 · L6: 2 · L7: 2 · L8: 1 · L9: 1\n\n**Cantrips** [[Fire Bolt]], [[Mage Hand]], [[Prestidigitation]], [[Light]], [[Message]]\n\n**Prepared** [[Shield]], [[Magic Missile]], [[Counterspell]], [[Fireball]], [[Fly]], [[Polymorph]], [[Dimension Door]], [[Cone of Cold]], [[Wall of Force]], [[Disintegrate]], [[Teleport]], [[Plane Shift]], [[Time Stop]], [[Wish]], [[Meteor Swarm]], [[Mind Blank]], [[Foresight]], [[Power Word Kill]], [[Dominate Monster]], [[Banishment]], [[Hold Monster]], [[Greater Invisibility]], [[Cloudkill]], [[Telekinesis]], [[Astral Projection]]\n\n## Equipment\n\n- 2 Daggers\n- Arcane Focus (Quarterstaff)\n- Robe\n- Spellbook\n- Scholar's Pack\n- 5 GP\n\n## Basics\n\n**Alignment:** Lawful Neutral\n\n**Role in your world:** The patron nobody has met\n\n**One-line concept:** Has been waiting at the top of a tower for someone to ask the right question.\n\n**Age:** 740\n\n## Appearance and voice\n\n**Appearance:** Shimmering robes that never quite hold one colour.\n\n**Voice:** Calm and amused, as if every sentence is a joke she has not told you yet.\n\n## Personality\n\n**Personality trait:** I am unfailingly polite, even to people I plan to remove from history.\n\n**Ideal:** Knowledge: the world is a puzzle to be solved.\n\n**Bond:** My students are the only thing I have left.\n\n**Flaw:** I cannot leave a mystery alone, even a dangerous one.\n\n## Backstory\n\n**Where did they grow up?** Born under a different moon, in a country that is no longer on any map.\n\n**Full backstory (free text):** Vaelith broke the rule that a wizard does not teach, and has been paying for it ever since.\n\n## Relationships\n\n**Allies and friends:** The Quiet Flame owes her a debt it does not remember.\n\n**Rivals and enemies:** The Hollow Choir.\n\n## Running this NPC\n\n**What they want:** An apprentice worthy of Orrin.\n\n**What they know:** Where Orrin went, and why the Hollow Choir sings at the weir.\n\n**Their secret:** Orrin is her student, and she sent him into the Hollow on purpose.\n\n**How to play them (voice, tics):** Answers a question with a better question. Only lies by omission.\n\n**Where to find them:** A tower that is somewhere different each time you look for it.\n\n---\n_Built with the SRD 5.2.1 (CC-BY 4.0). Includes material from the System Reference Document 5.2.1 (“SRD 5.2.1”) by Wizards of the Coast LLC, available at https://www.dndbeyond.com/srd. The SRD 5.2.1 is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License, available at https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode._\n\n<!-- dmforge:character {\"v\":1,\"kind\":\"npc\",\"name\":\"Archmage Vaelith\",\"level\":20,\"cls\":\"Wizard\",\"sub\":\"Evoker\",\"species\":\"Elf\",\"speciesNote\":\"High Elf\",\"bg\":\"Sage\",\"bgMode\":\"21\",\"bgA\":\"Int\",\"bgB\":\"Con\",\"method\":\"std\",\"base\":{\"Int\":15,\"Con\":14,\"Dex\":13,\"Wis\":12,\"Cha\":10,\"Str\":8},\"skills\":[\"Insight\",\"Investigation\"],\"extraSkill\":\"\",\"extraFeat\":\"\",\"cantrips\":[\"Fire Bolt\",\"Mage Hand\",\"Prestidigitation\",\"Light\",\"Message\"],\"prepared\":[\"Shield\",\"Magic Missile\",\"Counterspell\",\"Fireball\",\"Fly\",\"Polymorph\",\"Dimension Door\",\"Cone of Cold\",\"Wall of Force\",\"Disintegrate\",\"Teleport\",\"Plane Shift\",\"Time Stop\",\"Wish\",\"Meteor Swarm\",\"Mind Blank\",\"Foresight\",\"Power Word Kill\",\"Dominate Monster\",\"Banishment\",\"Hold Monster\",\"Greater Invisibility\",\"Cloudkill\",\"Telekinesis\",\"Astral Projection\"],\"kit\":\"A\",\"gear\":[]} -->\n"
};
